msgctxt "400"
msgid ""
"Did you know Gelateria Kamuro over on Taihei Boulevard is often packed with "
"businessmen?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid "Oh, really? I didn't know that place was so popular."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Popular enough for businessmen to swarm there, it seems."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid ""
"Hm... Pretty interesting! Maybe I'll stop by on the way home. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "448"
msgid ""
"I heard there's a famous actor who goes to eat at Sushi Gin undercover. "
"Noboru Kudarizaka, was it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "460"
msgid "I can't handle sushi. My stomach really just can't do raw shellfish..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "472"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "484"
msgid ""
"I'm sorry... I appreciate that you took the time to tell me. If you know any"
" other interesting things, I'd love to hear about them."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "496"
msgid ""
"I heard that the kimchi over at Kanrai is made with real peppers from Korea."
" Apparently it's really good for you, due to the... something-cin."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Really!? So the kimchi there is authentic?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Yeah, that's right."
msgstr "Sì, esatto."

msgctxt "532"
msgid ""
"You know, I love yakiniku. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I go to Kanrai all the "
"time, but I had no idea the peppers were from Korea. "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "544"
msgid ""
"I'll get some friends together, and we'll go for some authentic kimchi. "
"Thanks for the info, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "556"
msgid "I heard the ramen over at Kyushu No. 1 Star has a lot of collagen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "568"
msgid ""
"Oh, really? I had heard the food had improved, but I didn't know about the "
"collagen."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "580"
msgid "Why don't you go try it?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "592"
msgid "I just might. I'll grab a friend or two and head there soon."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "604"
msgid ""
"You know about the Yoshida Batting Center? What about the pro baseball "
"players who visit it from time to time?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "616"
msgid "Sorry... I kinda don't know anything about baseball."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "628"
msgid "I see."
msgstr "Capisco."

msgctxt "640"
msgid ""
"Sports just aren't my thing, you know? I guess exercise is still kind of "
"important, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "652"
msgid "Have you heard about the Matcha Fair over at Café Alps?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "664"
msgid ""
"Of course! ♪ I know where all the best snacks in Kamurocho\r\n"
"are! <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "676"
msgid "You like sweets?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "688"
msgid ""
"If I see a snack in front of me, I just have to gulp it down. And in one "
"bite, too! Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "700"
msgid "Have you tried the braised pork burger over at Smile Burger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "712"
msgid "Braised what now? What is that?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "724"
msgid "They put braised pork between two buns like a hamburger."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "736"
msgid "That must be super tasty... Though it also seems kinda weird..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "748"
msgid ""
"But... I guess it's kind of the same concept as a teriyaki burger, huh?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "760"
msgid "You could say that, yeah."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "772"
msgid ""
"Well, if you think it's worth it, maybe I'll give it a\r\n"
"try sometime. <Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "784"
msgid ""
"If you like shopping, you should check out Le Marche. I heard you can order "
"whatever bag you want there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "796"
msgid ""
"I dunno, it always feels like a waste to spend so much on brand-name bags."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "808"
msgid "Does it?"
msgstr "Davvero?"

msgctxt "820"
msgid ""
"Yeah. I have a really hard time accepting them as gifts, but I also feel bad"
" turning them down, so I end up taking them... But they just rot in my "
"closet anyway..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "832"
msgid "I prefer snacks and stuff as a present."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "844"
msgid ""
"Ever heard of Tantakatan? It's a shochu made of perilla... a type of herb."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "856"
msgid ""
"Tantakatan? I think they have that at the club, too. I don't think I've "
"really drank it much, though."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "868"
msgid ""
"I hear it's pretty tasty, and it's even better when you mix it with juice."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "880"
msgid ""
"That does sound tasty. I'll give it a try next time I get a chance. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "892"
msgid ""
"I heard the Okinawan Soba place in the Kariyushi Arcade has some rafute "
"soba, and it's apparently really delicious. Rich in collagen, too."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "904"
msgid "Rafute? That's like braised pork, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "916"
msgid ""
"I think I've seen it on TV before. Like, I guess the rafute from Okinawa "
"doesn't have excess fat, so it's actually pretty good for you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "928"
msgid "Oh, I'm surprised you knew."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "940"
msgid "Hehehe. I do know a few things here and there."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "952"
msgid ""
"Have you heard about the legendary appetizer at Aqua Sky in Hatsumachi? It's"
" over in Okinawa."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "964"
msgid "Huh...? No, I have no idea what you're talking about."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "976"
msgid "Well, there's a really famous appetizer there... You know what it is?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "988"
msgid ""
"An appetizer? Hmm... Well, since it's Okinawa... would it be something like "
"tofuyo?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1000"
msgid "Actually, it's salt."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1012"
msgid "Salt? Uh... Hold on, you mean, like, salt salt?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1024"
msgid ""
"Yeah. It's a rare kind of salt that's only in Okinawa. It's not just salty, "
"it has a hint of sweetness to it, too, which is supposed to bring out the "
"flavor in alcoholic drinks."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1036"
msgid "Wow... So their legendary appetizer is salt? That's so classy."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1048"
msgid "You should try it sometime."
msgstr "Dovresti provarla qualche volta."

msgctxt "1060"
msgid "Did you end up going to Gelateria Kamuro?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1072"
msgid ""
"Yes, I did! Their caramel gelato was amazing! I'm hooked! We should totally "
"go back, like, right now! Hehehe."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1084"
msgid "I'm glad to hear that."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1096"
msgid ""
"I'm so happy you told me about that place, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> I'm gonna get fat because of you, though. "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1108"
msgid "Did you check out Sushi Gin yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1120"
msgid ""
"I'm pretty sure I mentioned it, but... I can't really do sushi. Especially "
"shellfish..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1132"
msgid "Oh... Right..."
msgstr "Oh... Giusto..."

msgctxt "1144"
msgid ""
"I do wish I could eat it sometimes, though... But wishing won't change "
"anything, you know?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1156"
msgid "Did you try the kimchi at Kanrai yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1168"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah, I did. Capsaicin really packs a punch, huh? My mouth was totally "
"on fire."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1180"
msgid "It sure does."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1192"
msgid ""
"Oh, so the staff told me that the peppers from Korea are different from the "
"ones we use here in Japan. They've got a sweetness to them or something."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1204"
msgid ""
"Oh, yeah. And they also import the cabbage they use for the kimchi right "
"from Korea! Bet you didn't know that, Kiryu-san. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1216"
msgid "Oh yeah?"
msgstr "Ah sì?"

msgctxt "1228"
msgid ""
"I'm smarter than you think I am! <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> Anyway, if I "
"learn anything else cool, I'll definitely let you know. "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1240"
msgid "Have you gone to Kyushu No. 1 Star yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1252"
msgid ""
"I did, but... Turns out it's kiiinda not somewhere two girls should go "
"alone."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1264"
msgid "That's true."
msgstr "È vero."

msgctxt "1276"
msgid ""
"I think I'm getting addicted, though. If I get the sudden urge to go, I "
"might have to force you to come with me, Kiryu-san. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1288"
msgid "Did you check out the Yoshida Batting Center yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1300"
msgid ""
"Mmm... I think I mentioned it last time, but I don't really know much about "
"baseball..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1312"
msgid "Oh, right..."
msgstr "Ah, giusto..."

msgctxt "1324"
msgid "Did you go see the Matcha Fair over at Alps?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1336"
msgid "I totally did! ♪ I've conquered every single one already!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1348"
msgid "Heh. Not surprised."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1360"
msgid "Did you try the braised pork burger?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1372"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I did. I wasn't really giving it a fair shake before. Turns out it's "
"super delicious. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1384"
msgid "Thought you might like it."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1396"
msgid "Did I tell you about Le Marche's reservation system yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1408"
msgid ""
"Didn't I mention it before? I'm not really interested in super expensive "
"things like those bags..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1420"
msgid "Oh, that's right..."
msgstr "Ah, già."

msgctxt "1432"
msgid "I'm sorry... I appreciate that you told me at least...!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1444"
msgid "Have you tried Tantakatan yet?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1456"
msgid ""
"Yeah, I tried it today. I also learned the best way to drink it. Do you know"
" what that is, Kiryu-san?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1468"
msgid "No. What is it?"
msgstr "No, cos'è?"

msgctxt "1480"
msgid ""
"You mix it with cranberry juice. <Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> It's basically a "
"cocktail, I guess. It's, like... I can't even describe how good it is. "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1492"
msgid ""
"A girl could really fall in love with a flavor like that. "
"<Color:7>⑮<Color:Default> And that makes it pretty dangerous. Hehehe. "
"<Color:7>⑮⑮⑮<Color:Default>"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1504"
msgid "About the rafute soba from Okinawa..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1516"
msgid ""
"Oh, right. I was craving it after you told me about it, so I went out and "
"found an Okinawan restaurant in Tokyo."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1528"
msgid ""
"The rafute was great, but now I wanna try the authentic stuff in Okinawa!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1540"
msgid "You know about the legendary appetizer?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1552"
msgid "You told me about it last time. Okinawan salt, right?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "1564"
msgid ""
"Apparently you can't get it over here. Hey, I know! You should get some next"
" time you go to Okinawa!"
msgstr ""

